88
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:06,080
but that is, I think, really important to think 
about. So coming back to this AI research,  

89
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:12,160
how is this exponentially cheaper compute 
drive the AI research? Let's think about  

90
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:17,680
the job of the AI researchers. It is to teach 
machines how to think in a very general sense. 

91
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:25,280
And one somewhat unfortunately common approach 
is, we think about how we teach machine how we  

92
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:32,760
think we think. So meaning, we model how 
we think and then try to incorporate that  

