95
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:47,360
So it's fundamentally flawed in the sense that 
we try to model something that we have no idea  

96
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:52,840
about. And what happens if we go with this kind 
of approach is that, it poses a structure that  

97
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:58,080
serves as a shortcut in the short term, and so 
you can maybe get a paper or something. But then  

98
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:04,760
