150
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:03,840
at the time, and why they did that. Whether 
that was an optimal structure that could have  

151
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:09,920
been added at the time, and why they might 
be irrelevant now, and should we remove that? 

152
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:13,360
And we'll go through some of the 
