153
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:19,760
this will give you some flavor of what 
scaling research looks like. So now,  

154
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:23,400
we'll go into a little bit of the technical 
stuff, tech transformer architecture,  

155
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:28,560
there are some variants. I'll talk about 
three of them. First, is the encoder-decoder,  

156
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:31,840
which is the original transformer, 
which has a little bit more structure. 

157
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:37,240
Second one is the encoder-only, which is 
popularized by Bert. And then third one  

